              "text": "قرش — qirsh — \"a shark\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رأى الصيادون قرشا بجانب القارب. raʾā aṣ-ṣayyādūn qirshan bi-jānib al-qārib. The fishermen saw a shark beside the boat."
            },
